# Build verification before done

**Vercel** deploys on push and runs `next build` (with your project env vars). There is no GitHub Actions CI in this repo.

After substantive changes under `src/` or `pages/`:

1. Prefer `npm run verify` locally before pushing (lint + test + build).
2. **Production builds fail on ESLint errors** (e.g. missing Lucide imports). Fix errors, not only warnings.
3. When adding JSX icons/components, **add imports in the same edit**.
